{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","group":"90","path":"90/meta/90-overlap-audit.md","title":"Local Dependency and Interface Audit","display":"Local Dependency and Interface Audit","type":"interface-audit","metadata":{"type":"interface-audit","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-overlap-audit","aliases":["90-overlap-audit"],"display":"Local Dependency and Interface Audit","depends_on":["[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-free-variable]]","[[90-df-encoding]]","[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-ce-indexing]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-hilbert-bernays]]","[[90-df-essentially-undecidable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"interface-audit"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-overlap-audit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-overlap-audit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Local Dependency and Interface Audit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5385f3fe07cb98ef\" href=\"?note=5385f3fe07cb98ef\" title=\"90-df-free-variable\">90-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f303a307372354c\" href=\"?note=8f303a307372354c\" title=\"90-df-encoding\">90-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b88a00a8db9c1c07\" href=\"?note=b88a00a8db9c1c07\" title=\"90-df-ce-indexing\">90-df-ce-indexing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"76e7fe5e5759a867\" href=\"?note=76e7fe5e5759a867\" title=\"90-df-hilbert-bernays\">90-df-hilbert-bernays</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" href=\"?note=e3ae8bc1f7b51728\" title=\"90-df-essentially-undecidable\">90-df-essentially-undecidable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"本地依赖补齐与接口差异核查\">本地依赖补齐与接口差异核查</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是本书扁平签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^\\sharp\">\\(L^\\sharp\\)</span> 为其分层翻译；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。句法、自由变量、演算均取相应本地依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为集合论空列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span> 是词编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 是本书原素数积数值编码；两者的输出类型不同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\">\\(\\Phi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\\)</span> 是原 90-df-program-numbering 的同一编号族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\Phi_1(e)\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\Phi_1(e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e^\\Phi\">\\(W_e^\\Phi\\)</span> 为本地 CE 索引接口的实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,v,T_S,P\">\\(S,g,v,T_S,P\\)</span> 满足 HB/HBL 的共同环境，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq S\">\\(K\\subseteq S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_K\">\\(\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_K\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)\\)</span> 始终取原语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的呈示视图。</li>\n<li>本文件补齐原导航引用的悬空核查页。下列等式是本地接口之间的关系；未提供的外部原文不作为这些等式的额外前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Var}_L&amp;=\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_L=\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)&amp;=\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\epsilon)&amp;=\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\epsilon)=1,\\\\\nW_e&amp;=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=W_e^\\Phi,\\\\\nT\\vdash\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}(T,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HB}(T_S,P)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_{T_S}(P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\mathcal P)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Var}_L&amp;=\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_L=\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)&amp;=\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\epsilon)&amp;=\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\epsilon)=1,\\\\\nW_e&amp;=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=W_e^\\Phi,\\\\\nT\\vdash\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{FOL}},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}}(T,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HB}(T_S,P)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_{T_S}(P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\mathcal P)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EssUnd}_{S,g}(\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本页不宣称逐字复原第58、88或89本。未提供的外部依赖依据第90本已经使用的参数、输入输出、公式构造和调用条件补成局部定义；不扩展到未被调用的外部理论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"必须保持的接口区别\">必须保持的接口区别</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>扁平签名与分层签名通过 sharp 翻译；基础公式构造深度不占用原 Fml^(r) 的指定自由变量含义。</li>\n<li>原 GN_E 仍作用于固定表示的表达式域；新基础编号文件的特定语法域与操作条件不是它的替代定义。任何一个有效编号条件都不自行推出原始递归性。</li>\n<li>集合论有限列、wordenc 的二进制词、原素数积自然数序列码互不混同。通用整数纸带与原半无限纸带采用各自运行关系；原程序编号引理提供模拟桥梁。</li>\n<li>W_e 始终随实际编号族实例化；通用可接受编号的参数定理不把其它编号逐号搬入本书。</li>\n<li>原 StrongRep 继续要求内部统一存在唯一输出；GodelSys 的三元见证只补齐这一既定适用域，不降低为逐数存在唯一性。</li>\n<li>原 Q 保持算术语言中的三元呈示；跨语言调用 EssUnd 通过原 Ax 视图嵌入，不更换 Q 的对象。HB 始终是原 HBL 三模式的二元兼容名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"依赖迁移目录\">依赖迁移目录</h3>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原缺失目标</th>\n<th>本地补齐目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>58-df-omega.md</code></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>58-df-relation.md</code></td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"